G5465.def:
**χαλάω**, -ῶ
[in LXX: ([[Jer.38.6|Jer.38:6]]) (שָׁלַח pi.), etc. ;]
(a) **to slacken, loosen**;
(b) **to let loose, let go**;
(with) **to lower, let down**: with accusative of thing(s), [[Mrk.2.4|Mrk.2:4]], [[Luk.5.4-5|Luk.5:4-5]], [[Act.9.25; 27.17, 30|Act.9:25 27:17, 30]]; with accusative of person(s) (cf. Je, l.with), pass., [[2Co.11.33|2Co.11:33]]†
(AS)
